  <meta name="description" content="Meet TrackRS, an independent off-road rally game built by Saad AIT YAHIA, with design lead Ali ZOUHDI. Find your line across demanding terrain.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="TrackRS — Find your own line">
  <meta property="og:description" content="An independent off-road rally game. One road, nine cars, a whole world of terrain. Start with the free Linux demo.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <title>TrackRS — Find your own line</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <script src="script.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="TrackRS home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>TRACK<span class="brand-rs">RS</span></span></a>
    <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav" aria-label="Open navigation"><span></span><span></span></button>
    <nav class="site-nav" id="site-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#drive">The drive</a><a href="#garage">Garage</a><a href="#worlds">Worlds</a><a href="#team">People</a>
      <a class="nav-download" href="../trackrs-demo_0.6.7_amd64.deb" download>Get the demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <video class="hero-film" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="../data/maps/ahead/c.png" aria-hidden="true"><source src="../bin/inVideo.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
      <div class="hero-shade"></div>
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Independent rally game · Linux demo available</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">FIND<br>YOUR <span>OWN</span><br>LINE<span class="title-period">.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-intro">The road is never the whole story. Read the ground, trust the wheel, and make every corner yours in a rally game built around the feel of the drive.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-hot" href="../trackrs-demo_0.6.7_amd64.deb" download><span class="button-icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><span><strong>Download the demo</strong><small>Linux · Debian package · 0.6.7</small></span></a>
            <a class="text-link" href="#drive"><span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Discover TrackRS</a>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-note">The current demo opens the “Ahead” route. <a href="#download">See what’s included <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stamp" aria-label="TrackRS, independent rally project"><span class="stamp-top">TAKE THE<br>LONG WAY</span><span class="stamp-wheel" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="stamp-bottom">TRACKRS · INDEPENDENT</span></div>
        <div class="film-caption"><span class="caption-line"></span><span>IN-GAME FOOTAGE</span><span class="caption-location">AHEAD · DEMO ROUTE</span></div>
      </div>
      <a class="scroll-cue" href="#drive"><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span><i aria-hidden="true">↓</i></a>
    </section>

    <div class="ticker" aria-label="TrackRS highlights"><div class="ticker-track" aria-hidden="true"><span>BUILT FOR THE BACKROADS</span><b>✳</b><span>9 VEHICLE BUILDS</span><b>✳</b><span>132 MAP DEFINITIONS</span><b>✳</b><span>OPEN-SOURCE SPIRIT</span><b>✳</b><span>BUILT FOR THE BACKROADS</span><b>✳</b><span>9 VEHICLE BUILDS</span><b>✳</b><span>132 MAP DEFINITIONS</span><b>✳</b><span>OPEN-SOURCE SPIRIT</span><b>✳</b></div></div>

    <section class="intro-section section-wrap" id="drive" aria-labelledby="drive-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>01 / THE DRIVE</span><span class="kicker-rule"></span><span>LESS MENU. MORE MOMENT.</span></div>
      <div class="intro-grid"><h2 id="drive-title">A rally game<br>with its <em>boots</em><br>on the ground.</h2><div class="intro-body"><p class="lead">TrackRS is about the small decisions that make a big difference: when to brake, where to place a wheel, and how much you can ask from the surface beneath you.</p><p>Built as an independent project by Saad AIT YAHIA, TrackRS brings together rally cars, winding routes, and terrain that changes how the car responds. Gravel, mud, snow and rock are more than scenery. They are part of the conversation between you and the road.</p><a class="underlined-link" href="#worlds">Take a look around <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div></div>
      <div class="feature-row">
        <article class="feature-item"><span class="feature-number">01</span><div class="feature-symbol symbol-grip" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h3>Feel the surface</h3><p>Wheel grip and ground contact shift with the terrain. A clean line starts with reading what’s under you.</p></article>
        <article class="feature-item"><span class="feature-number">02</span><div class="feature-symbol symbol-route" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h3>Find the route</h3><p>Follow checkpoints through open landscapes, tight turns and long stretches that reward a steady hand.</p></article>
        <article class="feature-item"><span class="feature-number">03</span><div class="feature-symbol symbol-wheel" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div><h3>Make it yours</h3><p>Choose a camera, tune your controls, or plug in a joystick. The cockpit should feel like your own.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="garage-section" id="garage" aria-labelledby="garage-title"><div class="section-wrap garage-wrap">
      <div class="section-kicker section-kicker-light"><span>02 / THE GARAGE</span><span class="kicker-rule"></span><span>NINE BUILDS. YOUR CALL.</span></div>
      <div class="garage-heading"><div><h2 id="garage-title">Pick your<br><em>personality.</em></h2></div><p>From rally-bred WRC machines to lighter kitcars and Super 500 builds, the garage gives you a different way to meet the same road.</p></div>
      <div class="garage-showcase">
        <div class="garage-image-wrap"><video class="garage-film" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="../data/maps/ahead/c.png" aria-label="TrackRS rally gameplay showing a car crossing rugged terrain"><source src="../intro.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><span class="image-corner image-corner-top">TRACKRS / 0.6.7</span><span class="image-corner image-corner-bottom">NO TWO LINES FEEL THE SAME</span><button class="film-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Play garage footage"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span></button></div>
        <div class="garage-side"><p class="garage-label">THE LINEUP</p><ul class="car-list"><li><span>01</span><strong>WRC</strong><small>Built to push</small></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Kitcar</strong><small>Light on its feet</small></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Super 500</strong><small>Made for momentum</small></li></ul><div class="garage-callout"><span class="callout-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>Nine vehicle definitions are included in the game data. The current demo is focused on one route: <strong>Ahead.</strong></p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="worlds-section section-wrap" id="worlds" aria-labelledby="worlds-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>03 / THE WORLD</span><span class="kicker-rule"></span><span>132 MAP DEFINITIONS IN THE GAME DATA</span></div>
      <div class="worlds-heading"><h2 id="worlds-title">No perfect<br><em>conditions.</em></h2><p>Every route asks a different question. Explore the wider TrackRS map library, then start with the route available in this demo.</p></div>
      <div class="world-board">
        <article class="world-card world-card-main"><img src="../data/maps/ahead/c.png" alt="Overhead color map of the Ahead rally route" loading="lazy"><div class="world-card-content"><span class="world-tag">DEMO ROUTE · PLAYABLE</span><h3>Ahead</h3><p>One long road to settle into. The place to learn the rhythm of TrackRS.</p><a href="#download" class="world-link">Start here <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><span class="map-coordinate">ROUTE 001 / AHEAD</span></article>
        <article class="world-card world-card-small world-desert"><img src="../data/maps/aegyptian/c.png" alt="Terrain color map from the Aegyptian route" loading="lazy"><div class="world-card-content"><span class="world-tag">MAP LIBRARY</span><h3>Aegyptian</h3><p>Open ground. A long horizon.</p></div><span class="map-coordinate">01 — DRY COUNTRY</span></article>
        <article class="world-card world-card-small world-green"><img src="../data/maps/greenland/c.png" alt="Terrain color map from the Greenland route" loading="lazy"><div class="world-card-content"><span class="world-tag">MAP LIBRARY</span><h3>Greenland</h3><p>A different kind of grip.</p></div><span class="map-coordinate">02 — HIGH GROUND</span></article>
      </div>
      <p class="library-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> Map library art shown from the game data. The included demo currently unlocks the Ahead route only.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="controls-section" aria-labelledby="controls-title"><div class="section-wrap controls-wrap">
      <div class="section-kicker section-kicker-light"><span>04 / THE COCKPIT</span><span class="kicker-rule"></span><span>YOUR HANDS. YOUR CALL.</span></div>
      <div class="controls-grid"><div><h2 id="controls-title">Simple to learn.<br><em>Hard to leave.</em></h2><p class="controls-copy">The default keyboard layout gets you moving quickly. Change views, check the map, recover at a checkpoint, and get back on the line.</p></div><div class="key-table" role="list" aria-label="Default game controls">
        <div class="key-row" role="listitem"><span class="keycap-group"><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd></span><span>Accelerate / brake &amp; reverse</span></div><div class="key-row" role="listitem"><span class="keycap-group"><kbd>←</kbd><kbd>→</kbd></span><span>Steer</span></div><div class="key-row" role="listitem"><span class="keycap-group"><kbd>SPACE</kbd></span><span>Handbrake</span></div><div class="key-row" role="listitem"><span class="keycap-group"><kbd>C</kbd><kbd>M</kbd></span><span>Camera / map</span></div><div class="key-row" role="listitem"><span class="keycap-group"><kbd>R</kbd><kbd>Q</kbd></span><span>Recover / previous checkpoint</span></div><div class="key-row" role="listitem"><span class="keycap-group"><kbd>P</kbd></span><span>Pause</span></div>
      </div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="team-section section-wrap" id="team" aria-labelledby="team-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>05 / THE PEOPLE</span><span class="kicker-rule"></span><span>A SMALL TEAM, A BIG ROAD</span></div>
      <div class="team-heading"><h2 id="team-title">Made with<br><em>intention.</em></h2><p>TrackRS is an independent game project built by people who care about the feeling of a good drive, the details of a world, and the freedom to make something their own.</p></div>
      <div class="people-grid">
        <article class="person person-founder"><div class="person-index">01 <span>CREATOR / DEVELOPER</span></div><div class="person-monogram" aria-hidden="true">SY</div><h3>Saad<br>AIT YAHIA</h3><p>Creator and developer of TrackRS. Building the game, shaping its feel, and bringing this independent rally project to life.</p><a href="https://github.com/Saad-programmer" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="person-link">Follow the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        <article class="person person-design"><div class="person-index">02 <span>DESIGN LEAD</span></div><div class="person-monogram" aria-hidden="true">AZ</div><h3>Ali<br>ZOUHDI</h3><p>Design lead, shaping the visual language and helping TrackRS feel like a world with a point of view.</p><span class="person-link person-credit">A key part of the TrackRS team <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></span></article>
        <aside class="team-note"><span class="team-asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>Independent by nature.<br><strong>Open by design.</strong></p><a href="https://github.com/Saad-programmer/TRackRS" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underlined-link">Explore the source <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
      </div>
