///////////////////////////
// TrackRS v0.6.x README //
///////////////////////////


Thanks for downloading TrackRS! I hope you enjoy the game.

Creator:
  Saad AIT YAHIA - @github: Saad-programmer

Before playing, building, or copying, please read the license later in this file.


